# Input for the second part of `make test` (desktop mode: the Desktop starts Hex View
# from its Programs menu, without an argument). Time 0 = the program was started.
# 1. no file yet: an empty box and a hint in the status line (View's items are dimmed)
1000 shot
# 2. File > Open... (ctrl+O): the file dialog, centred, shows the card's root
+200 ^O
+1500 shot
# a double click on LONG.TXT (its row is at screen 170, 239; 0.26: below /Music) opens it (the pointer
# then moves out of the way, for screenshot.png)
+200 move 170 239
+300 dclick
+300 move 560 346
+900 shot
# 3. PgDn, then End (LONG.TXT ends inside its last line: the rest of that line is blank)
+200 {pgdn}
+500 shot
+200 {end}
+500 shot
# 4. drag and drop: Programs > Files (the 11th item, 0.22) opens a Files window over ours; drag README.TXT
# (its row at screen 100, 217; 0.26: below /Music) and release it on Hex View's box (at 520, 200)
+300 move 110 6
+200 click
+400 move 100 177
+200 click
+2000 move 100 217
+200 press
+100 drag 520 200
+800 release
+1000 shot
# a click on Hex View's title bar brings it to the front: README.TXT, 110 bytes
+200 move 480 34
+200 click
+800 shot
